  "interpretation": "<ul data-start=\"1391\" data-end=\"1941\">\n<li data-start=\"1391\" data-end=\"1497\">\n<p data-start=\"1393\" data-end=\"1497\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">Detects <strong data-start=\"1401\" data-end=\"1453\">monogenic disorders or chromosomal abnormalities</strong> in embryos before implantation during IVF</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"1498\" data-end=\"1614\">\n<p data-start=\"1500\" data-end=\"1614\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">Ensures <strong data-start=\"1508\" data-end=\"1572\">single embryo sample is free from maternal DNA contamination</strong>, which could affect diagnostic accuracy</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"1615\" data-end=\"1941\">\n<p data-start=\"1617\" data-end=\"1634\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\"><strong data-start=\"1617\" data-end=\"1634\">Result Notes:</strong></span></p>\n<ul data-start=\"1637\" data-end=\"1941\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"1637\" data-end=\"1697\">\n<p data-start=\"1639\" data-end=\"1697\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\"><strong data-start=\"1639\" data-end=\"1657\">\"Not Detected\"</strong> in contamination = result is reliable</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"1700\" data-end=\"1813\">\n<p data-start=\"1702\" data-end=\"1813\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\"><strong data-start=\"1702\" data-end=\"1716\">\"Detected\"</strong> = indicates potential contamination; may compromise validity, consider re-sampling if possible</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"1816\" data-end=\"1941\">\n<p data-start=\"1818\" data-end=\"1941\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">Embryo genetic status: reported as <strong data-start=\"1853\" data-end=\"1921\">Normal / Affected / Carrier / Aneuploid / Balanced Translocation</strong>, based on test type</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>",
